<title>FRANCE: Dumez-GTM wins contract in Thailand.</title>
<headline>Dumez-GTM wins contract in Thailand.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dumez-GTM, a construction unit of Suez Lyonnaise des Eaux, said on Monday it had won a contract with Germany's Dywidag for the extension of a highway viaduct in Thailand.</p>
<p>It said the contract, for 630 million francs, was for the construction of 6.8 km of viaduct. It said work would last 20 months.</p>
</text>
